# Uploads. Nothing a user or a test run puts here belongs in the repository.
#
# This used to name one directory -- media/design_library/ -- while stating the
# intent for all of them, and the gap showed: sixteen files under media/ were
# tracked, including two customer-scoped fabric photographs under
# media/fabrics/cust_<uuid>/ and images uploaded through the customer profile
# form. Those are a boutique's clients' pictures, committed to a git remote.
#
# So the rule is inverted: everything under media/ is ignored, and the handful
# of seeded catalogue images the application genuinely ships with are named back
# in. `media/*` rather than `media/` is load-bearing -- git does not descend into
# an excluded directory, so the un-ignore lines below would never be consulted.
#
# Adding a new seeded image means adding it here. That is the point: it makes
# committing an upload a deliberate act rather than the default.
media/*
!media/design_ai_*.jpg
!media/design_cat_*.jpg
!media/fabric_*.jpg

# Generated by docs/user-guide/build_pdf.py -- rebuilt on demand.
docs/user-guide/pdf-build/

# Android (Capacitor).
#
# The web build that gets packaged, the Gradle output, and the two files that
# must never reach a remote:
#
#   local.properties     -- absolute SDK path from whoever built last.
#   keystore.properties  -- passwords for the upload key.
#   *.keystore / *.jks   -- the upload key itself. Google Play identifies this
#                           app by that key permanently: committing it lets
#                           anyone who can read this repository publish an
#                           update as Boutique CRM, and there is no rotating it
#                           afterwards.
#
# android/app/src/main/assets/public/ is the copied web build, regenerated by
# `npx cap sync`, and google-services.json carries the Firebase project
# configuration for the deployment rather than for the source tree.
frontend/dist-android/
frontend/android/local.properties
frontend/android/keystore.properties
frontend/android/app/google-services.json
frontend/android/.gradle/
frontend/android/build/
frontend/android/app/build/
frontend/android/capacitor-cordova-android-plugins/build/
frontend/android/app/src/main/assets/public/
frontend/android/app/src/main/assets/capacitor.config.json
frontend/android/app/src/main/assets/capacitor.plugins.json
*.keystore
*.jks
